{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1132098-how-would-you-do-a-punisher-style-scion","id":1132098,"title":"How would you do a Punisher style Scion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-20T23:19:57-07:00","id":1132098,"title":"How would you do a Punisher style Scion","content":"A idea suddenly sprang into my head. What if a Scion used his or her powers to start fighting crime like the Punisher from Marvel Comics? How would you make this type of character work in a Scion chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-21T00:42:52-07:00","id":1132114,"title":"","content":"Well there actually are a few vengeance gods in various pantheons; so I suppose the first thing to ask would be are you making the character actually a Scion of ,say, Nemesis or unrelated and just fed up with all the bull in traditional law and order.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-21T01:12:39-07:00","id":1132115,"title":"","content":"Given how he fights, the character should have the War Purview. Probably Warrior and Judge callings. Maybe Hunter for his third, but we don't know how inherently &quot;wilderness&quot; bound or not that calling is going to be.<br /> <br /> If he's a born Scion with a divine parent, he doesn't necessarily need to be the child of a &quot;vengeance&quot; god - it might be interesting if he broke from his parent to walk this path - perhaps hating their parent for failing to prevent whatever tragedy drove them to this.<br /> <br /> Alternatively a Chosen Scion is probably someone who was mortal before they took up this cause, and in picking it up was divinely empowered by a Vengeance deity. Nemesis and Vidarr spring to mind immediately as the most obvious choices.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 08-21-2017, 05:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-21T06:23:31-07:00","id":1132180,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1132098-how-would-you-do-a-punisher-style-scion?p=1132115#post1132115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given how he fights, the character should have the War Purview. Probably Warrior and Judge callings. Maybe Hunter for his third, but we don't know how inherently &quot;wilderness&quot; bound or not that calling is going to be.<br /> <br /> If he's a born Scion with a divine parent, he doesn't necessarily need to be the child of a &quot;vengeance&quot; god - it might be interesting if he broke from his parent to walk this path - perhaps hating their parent for failing to prevent whatever tragedy drove them to this.<br /> <br /> Alternatively a Chosen Scion is probably someone who was mortal before they took up this cause, and in picking it up was divinely empowered by a Vengeance deity. Nemesis and Vidarr spring to mind immediately as the most obvious choices.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I would add Death, Darkness and good at Physical Attributes and Wits. Could be a descendant of a Furie too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1837-wickedgrail","name":"Wickedgrail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1837_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-21T19:42:57-07:00","id":1132474,"title":"","content":"I am torn between making him the son of Nemesis or a former Chaplin turned vigilante who was claimed by Sekhmet and turned into a Scion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-22T18:39:29-07:00","id":1132884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1132098-how-would-you-do-a-punisher-style-scion?p=1132115#post1132115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe Hunter for his third, but we don't know how inherently &quot;wilderness&quot; bound or not that calling is going to be.</div> </div> </div> </div>I seem to recall one of the previews mentioning Hunter being usable by a hacker or something like that so, if my memory is not playing tricks on me, it is probably not all that tied to wilderness.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T00:20:38-07:00","id":1132937,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1132098-how-would-you-do-a-punisher-style-scion?p=1132884#post1132884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I seem to recall one of the previews mentioning Hunter being usable by a hacker or something like that so, if my memory is not playing tricks on me, it is probably not all that tied to wilderness.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I think Hunters just, y'know, pursue and hunt things. They don't have to be living beings, they just have to be things you pursue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T08:03:30-07:00","id":1133012,"title":"","content":"interesting idea, after all, Frank Castle's story could very well be that of a Greek Hero, in several of the tales.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12529-nico-diangelo","name":"Nico diAngelo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12529_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T08:04:35-07:00","id":1133013,"title":"","content":"how about a god of Justice/Judgment?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12529-nico-diangelo","name":"Nico diAngelo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12529_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T07:31:47-07:00","id":1134459,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Ogbunabali of the Igbo Pantheon, a former vigilante turned death deity who specifically collects criminals, would be a really cool divine parent for this sort of character.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13079-wannabe-demon-lord","name":"Wannabe Demon Lord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T10:06:01-07:00","id":1134509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wannabe Demon Lord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1132098-how-would-you-do-a-punisher-style-scion?p=1134459#post1134459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Ogbunabali of the Igbo Pantheon, a former vigilante turned death deity who specifically collects criminals, would be a really cool divine parent for this sort of character.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Or patron. Chosen really seems a better fit than Born to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-27T10:11:24-07:00","id":1134510,"title":"","content":"I think I like Chosen. My guy will probably be a former cop turned bloodthirsty vigilante after his elderly parents were killed by burglars. When he started his career, he prayed to multiple deities like Nemesis, Sekhmet and a couple other deities. Of course, one of them answered and gave him their patronage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}